  {
   "name": "Here's what happens when you ship an issue.",
   "s": 2.75,
   "e": 4.85
  },
  {
   "name": "Ship reads the ticket, opens a fresh git worktree and writes a failing test first.",
   "s": 4.85,
   "e": 9.33
  },
  {
   "name": "Then it makes the test pass, runs the full gate and opens a pull request.",
   "s": 9.33,
   "e": 13.25
  },
  {
   "name": "A reviewer bot leaves comments on the diff.",
   "s": 13.25,
   "e": 15.53
  },
  {
   "name": "Ship answers each thread, pushes one fix per round and waits for CI to turn green.",
   "s": 15.53,
   "e": 20.49
  },
  {
   "name": "Only then does it merge and the branch is cleaned up for you.",
   "s": 20.49,
   "e": 24.0
  },
  {
   "name": "End card",
   "s": 24.0,
   "e": 30.0
